Body:
@lorrandavid , OpenCode offers amazing configuration granularity. You can experiment with this setting:
```json
{
  "$schema": "https://opencode.ai/config.json",
  "small_model": "github-copilot/gpt-5-mini",
  "agent": {
    "compaction": {
      "model": "github-copilot/gpt-5-mini"
    }
  }
}
``` 
This way compaction will be done with a zero-multiplier model. GPT 5 mini is not perfect for coding tasks but maybe it can handle compaction just fine. It is worth giving a try.

